- [x] Clean global `src/types/index.ts` to focus on shared action contracts (`export * from './action'`) and clean re-exports.
- [x] Export unexported functions in `src/utils/formatters.ts` (`formatCurrency`, `truncateText`, `formatTime`).
- [x] Export `UpdateEventSchema` and `UpdateEventFormData` in `src/features/events/schema/event.ts`.
- [x] Delete empty `app/api/` directory.

## Option B: Desk & Realtime Performance Polish [COMPLETED]
- [x] Deduplicate `toDeskStudent`: Shared `ATTENDEE_SELECT` and `toDeskStudent` moved to `src/features/events/utils.ts`.
